OpenVLA represents an exemplary application of BMAD methodology to produce high-quality project deliverables. The project demonstrates how internal BMAD processes generate comprehensive, well-structured documentation that can stand on its own as complete project artifacts.

**Important Clarification**: BMAD represents the internal engineering methodology/framework, while OpenVLA artifacts are the specific project deliverables produced by applying BMAD. These are separate entities - BMAD is the process, OpenVLA is the outcome.

